# The copier check's end (MirrorCheckTask, $81:A37A): caught, it waits 30
# times 63 frames, then sets V_03FB to $3F every 255 frames for ever
# ($81:A3BC). The scripts that run it with the copier RAM on (cartram) end
# before the 1890 frames, or lose the level (and the task) first. On the
# first level, with the copier RAM on, the task is created again in its
# slot 7 (record $0117, stack top $02EA) the way the level's load does
# (TaskCreate: its entry less one and bank at the stack's top, its saved
# S, state new), and left for 2300 frames, Aladdin standing.
load build/aladdin/states/level1.state
cartram on
wait 10
poke $0002EB 79,A3,81
poke $000119 EA,02
poke $000117 0C
wait 2300
